        <footnote id="F4">Represents the vesting of the third and final tranche of a performance-based restricted stock unit award granted on May 15, 2018.  By its terms, the award vested ratably in one-third increments on the first, second and third anniversaries of the award date provided that:  (i) the reporting person remained continuously employed by the Company; and (ii) certain performance criteria related to cost savings and completion of previously announced divestiture programs were satisfied.  Unexpired portions of the award were subject to earlier vesting without regard to achievement of the performance criteria in the event of death or disability.  Unexpired portions of the award were subject to vesting pro rata, based on time in service, and without regard to achievement of the performance criteria, in the event of retirement.</footnote>
